#. Description of the plugin
#: kits-core.php
msgid "Kits by Wugweb, the site features every Kits site shares: form engine with spam guard (ALTCHA) and per-field errors, share bar, Google Tag Manager with consent mode, an honest visit counter, preview-only items, source attribution and the publisher records the sourcing plugin uses; plus the design system index of the Kits theme and its child. Own menu: Kits (Overview, Design system, Preview). Configured by the site through filters (kits_*)."
